      "raw": "[quote=\"\"SlenderTroll\"\"]\n\nActually, I'd vote for a 10-point scale for that same reason. (Not that I really get a vote.) If you give people a middle point, they're likely to choose it unusually often, which'll mess with your data. Force people to pick between slightly-above and slightly-below the middle.\n\n[/quote]\nYeah, we have experienced that at work - for all surveys, we ensure there is no mid-point because it is more likely to result in accurate responses. \n\nRabit",
